  "decision_basis": "Desktop verification by Codex: unchanged CSV point lies in named Kendalkerep OSM way 629408229 v2 (2021-01-20), reconstructed at 2024-12-31. Official Malang health profile 2021, physical page 34, printed page 12, table 2.2 row 11 confirms Sulfat 100/Blimbing and distinguishes Kendalsari in row 16. Current official profile agrees. The conflicting 2015 article names Kendalsari and Sulfat 02; retained but outweighed by the later dated table and named historical footprint. No claim about cause of discrepancy. Not field survey or proof of occupancy throughout 2024.",
